# CloudFormation templates.
#
# Prettier's YAML formatter collapses folded block scalars (`Description: >`)
# and silently drops content from them - it removed ~47 lines of the explanatory
# header from readonly-role.yaml. CloudFormation also uses short-form
# intrinsics (!Ref, !Sub, !GetAtt) that are not portable YAML tags. Neither is
# worth reformatting; both are worth not corrupting.
infra/*.yaml

# Helm templates are Go templating inside YAML: `{{ include ... }}` where a
# key or a value should be. Prettier parses them as YAML and fails, which is
# correct of it. `helm lint` and `helm template` check these instead, and
# apps/api/src/security/chart.test.ts guards the invariants that matter.
helm/*/templates/
helm/*/values.schema.json

# Generated from apps/api/src/observability/metrics.ts and embedded in the
# ConfigMap beside it; dashboard.test.ts keeps the two in step.
deploy/grafana-dashboard-configmap.yaml
